 554:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** *
 555:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * Selects the direct source for the HFCLK.
 556:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** *
 557:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * The new source must be running and stable before calling this function.
 558:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** *
 559:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * PSoC 4000:
 560:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * The SYSCLK has a maximum speed of 16 MHz, so HFCLK and SYSCLK dividers should
 561:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * be selected in a way to not to exceed 16 MHz for the System clock.
 562:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** *
 563:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * If the SYSCLK clock frequency increases during device operation, call
 564:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * CySysFlashSetWaitCycles() with the appropriate parameter to adjust the number
 565:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * of clock cycles the cache will wait before sampling data comes back from
 566:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * Flash. If the SYSCLK clock frequency decreases, you can call
 567:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * CySysFlashSetWaitCycles() to improve the CPU performance. See
 568:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * CySysFlashSetWaitCycles() description for more information.
 569:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** *
 570:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * Do not select PLL as the source for HFCLK if PLL output frequency exceeds
 571:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * maximum permissible value for HFCLK.
