 735:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * should be selected in a way, not to exceed 16 MHz for SYSCLK.
