 737:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * PSoC 4100 \ PSoC 4100 BLE \ PSoC 4100M: The SYSCLK has the speed of 24 MHz,
