 744:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * from Flash. If the SYSCLK clock frequency decreases, you can call
