 806:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c **** * PSoC 4000: The System Clock (SYSCLK) has maximum speed of 16 MHz, so HFCLK
