1467:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c ****         * Filter frequency trim - This bit field sets LPF frequency trim and affects
