1470:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c ****         * Feedback resistor trim - This bit field sets the feedback resistor trim and
