1473:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c ****         * Amplifier gain trim - This bit field sets the amplifier gain trim and affects
