1550:C:\Program Files (x86)\Cypress\PSoC Creator\4.4\PSoC Creator\1\LWO4.cydsn\Generated_Source\PSoC4\CyLib.c ****         * This API is available only for PSoC 4200L / 4100S / 4500 with ECO
